## Interface: 120000, 120001
## Title: Dude Where's My K'arroc
## Notes: Campaign-based mount constraints, with a retrieval service for the mounts you leave behind.
## Author: Squirrelthug
## Version: 2.0.0
## IconTexture: 6841151
## X-Category: Roleplay
## X-Website: https://github.com/Squirrelthug/DWMK

## SavedVariables: DWMKDB, DismountedDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: DWMKCharDB, DismountedCharDB

# Key bindings for the Ride button.
Bindings.xml

# Strings first so every module can reference them at load time.
Locale/enUS.lua

# Core - order matters: each module may reference the ones above it.
Core/Init.lua
Core/DB.lua
Core/Mount.lua
Core/Presets.lua
Core/Rules.lua
Core/RideButton.lua
Core/Waypoint.lua
Core/MapCircle.lua
Core/Notify.lua
Core/Retrieval.lua

# UI
UI/Widgets.lua
UI/CampaignPicker.lua
UI/Config.lua
UI/Tracker.lua

# Commands and the debug harness last - they reach into everything above.
Core/Commands.lua
Core/Debug.lua
